#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Callback function `cb` is called for each schema object (not including "
"draft-06 boolean schemas), including the root schema, in pre-order "
"traversal. Schema references ($ref) are not resolved, they are passed as "
"is.  Alternatively, you can pass a `{pre, post}` object as `cb`, and then"
" `pre` will be called before traversing child elements, and `post` will "
"be called after all child elements have been traversed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:50
msgid "Callback is passed these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:52
msgid "_schema_: the current schema object"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:53
msgid "_JSON pointer_: from the root schema to the current schema object"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:54
msgid "_root schema_: the schema passed to `traverse` object"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:55
msgid ""
"_parent JSON pointer_: from the root schema to the parent schema object "
"(see below)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:56
msgid ""
"_parent keyword_: the keyword inside which this schema appears (e.g. "
"`properties`, `anyOf`, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"_parent schema_: not necessarily parent object/array; in the example "
"above the parent schema for `{type: 'string'}` is the root schema"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"_index/property_: index or property name in the array/object containing "
"multiple schemas; in the example above for `{type: 'string'}` the "
"property name is `'foo'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:61
msgid "Traverse objects in all unknown keywords"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-schema-traverse_README.md:78
msgid ""
"Without option `allKeys: true` callback will be called only with root "
"schema."
msgstr ""

